// NPC kinds (game::npc). Each has looks (sRGB colours of its body parts),
// a voice (pitch of the voice sounds, syllables per second) and a dialogue
// tree from dialogue.ron. Ctrl+Shift+N (or Cmd+Shift+N) spawns one ahead of you, the next kind
// each press (`BLOCKGAME_NPC_KIND=gilm` picks one for `BLOCKGAME_NPC`).
// looks: `scale` (0.55 = one block tall), `extras` = boxes on the Head / Torso / Hips
// ((size), (at) in the part's frame at full size, the model faces -z), `blank: true` = no expression.
// urn: asked to follow, it settles by that urn once you lead it there and wanders near it (recruited).
